        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZeroZeta is a precision racing game that is:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >true minimal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weird and different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >very chill and calming</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through hand-crafted levels and shave milliseconds from your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/fa4df7ff31862447e674e58686c50464.avif?t=1757951960\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras_big/fa4df7ff31862447e674e58686c50464.webp?t=1757951960 width=1560 height=836 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to great surreal, lo-fi and ambient music and satisfying sound effects. <br>Discover the flow of perfect runs.<br>Whether you're chasing personal bests or just casually gliding, ZeroZeta is a game you can sink into. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/3186547e628f5e027148c3804cfda0db.avif?t=1757951960\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras_big/3186547e628f5e027148c3804cfda0db.webp?t=1757951960 width=1560 height=832 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score - start with a set time for each level, finish quicker to get more score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/ff7464ac006cff6be964044103e328bf.avif?t=1757951960\" width=174 height=168 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles - the game contains 5 types of obstacles, learn to use them to your advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/997cfd3accbe8fa9c853771142945cea.avif?t=1757951960\" width=876 height=528 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal controls - you can only turn left/right, you auto thrust forward, be creative when you need to brake</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable options - best score on a level counts towards a sum, as you sum rises you will unlock more options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/642721af89b7c81e96acc44a08954877.avif?t=1757951960\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras_big/642721af89b7c81e96acc44a08954877.webp?t=1757951960 width=1560 height=832 /></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZeroZeta is a precision racing game that is:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >true minimal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weird and different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >very chill and calming</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through hand-crafted levels and shave milliseconds from your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/fa4df7ff31862447e674e58686c50464.avif?t=1757951960\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras_big/fa4df7ff31862447e674e58686c50464.webp?t=1757951960 width=1560 height=836 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to great surreal, lo-fi and ambient music and satisfying sound effects. <br>Discover the flow of perfect runs.<br>Whether you're chasing personal bests or just casually gliding, ZeroZeta is a game you can sink into. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/3186547e628f5e027148c3804cfda0db.avif?t=1757951960\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras_big/3186547e628f5e027148c3804cfda0db.webp?t=1757951960 width=1560 height=832 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score - start with a set time for each level, finish quicker to get more score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/ff7464ac006cff6be964044103e328bf.avif?t=1757951960\" width=174 height=168 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles - the game contains 5 types of obstacles, learn to use them to your advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/997cfd3accbe8fa9c853771142945cea.avif?t=1757951960\" width=876 height=528 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal controls - you can only turn left/right, you auto thrust forward, be creative when you need to brake</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable options - best score on a level counts towards a sum, as you sum rises you will unlock more options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras/642721af89b7c81e96acc44a08954877.avif?t=1757951960\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960120/extras_big/642721af89b7c81e96acc44a08954877.webp?t=1757951960 width=1560 height=832 /></span></p></li></ul>",
